    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n44762" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sŏpōrĭfer</span></b> ,
			fĕra, fĕrum, adj.
		sopor-fero, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>sleep-bringing</i>, <i>inducing
			sleep</i>, <i>sleepy</i>, <i>drowsy</i>
				(<b>poet.</b> and in post-Aug. prose): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">papaver,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Verg.
					A. 4, 486</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">lac,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					19, 8, 38, § 126</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">potio,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Spart. Hadr. 26 <i>fin.</i></span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vis pinnae,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					9, 13, 15, § 42</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">genus (trychni),</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id.
					21, 31, 105, § 180</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">somnus,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Luc. 3,
					8</span></i>
			; cf.: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">aula Somni,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ov.
					M. 11, 586</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">nox,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Sil.
					7, 287</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Petr. poët. 128, 6, 1: Lethe,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Ov.
					Tr. 4, 1, 47</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vices,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Claud. Rapt. Pros. 3, 404</span></i>
			.</div>
